        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi Israeli waan nani jed'e, Muduunu daad'i, ta dallansuuni tiyya keesa jirtu tana, naraa fuud'i, gosa anini iti si erge tana ch'ufa obaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri yo d'uge dadaaqe mamaraata, maro woraana anini worrati erguufi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba anini muduunu suni AABBO Waaqa iraa fuud'e, gosa inni iti na erge ch'ufa obaase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerusalemufi dira Yuda ch'ufafi hayyoota isiitiifi jaarole isii ch'ufale inobaasani, duuba lafti worraa badde ona taate, hojja qaabatani ch'ufa nami waan isii iraa rifata, maqa isiitiini woli abaara — akuma arrale woli tolchani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunini maqa worra muduunu suni keesaa wo d'uge: Hayyu Misiritiifi jara hojattu isaa gugurdafi jaarole isaatifi nama lafa isaa ch'ufafi nama gosa d'ibi ka lafa isaani keesa godaanule; hayyoota lafa Uzi: Hayyoota dira Filisti, ka Ashkelonifi Gazafi Ekroni, ammalle dira Ashdodi gama hafele; worra gosa Edomufi Moabufi Amonile; hayyoota Tirotifi ta Sidonile; hayyoota lafa afaani baariini ch'ufa; dira Dedanitifi Temafi Buzi; worra mata gabaabse ch'iratu ch'ufa; hayyoota Arafti; hayyoota gosa lafa gamooji keesa teetu ch'ufa; hayyoota lafa Zimritifi ta Elamutifi ta Medi ch'ufa; hayyoota lafa mirga ta fago teetufi ta d'io teetule woluma gulaani; gosa lafa gubba jirtu ch'ufa haguma isiini geetunu inobaasani. Duuba eege qit'isu hayyu Babilonile obaasani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.19+JER.25.20+JER.25.21+JER.25.22+JER.25.23+JER.25.24+JER.25.25+JER.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.25.19",
